      <activity id="668d20e1-a446-5409-aec4-10309eb5c08f" activityNameId="af698452-91ad-516c-9932-a2b20c4d605e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">CEM III, A cement, GGBFS with burdens, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: CEM III, A cement, GGBFS with burdens, at plant
The dataset describes the production of cement (CEM III-A) in Switzerland .\nTechnology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Bindemittel\nUVEK 2022 source file:551-Zement-Klinker_v0.13_UVEK2021._CEM III-B - with burdens.xml\n\n
UUID: 89dbc997-bbc5-35fb-ba59-0551b8ecadf7
From cradle, i.e. including all upstream activities. As source of gypsum, waste gypsum from flue gas treatment is assumed. The burdens for the production of ground granulated blast furnace slag (GGBFS) are accounted for (economic allocation). 
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from the association of the swiss cement industry (cemsuisse) representing average production in Switzerland 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_89dbc997-bbc5-35fb-ba59-0551b8ecadf7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
